---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="후원 — Word of Life Korea"
  description="월코 사역 후원 및 선교사 개인 후원 — Word of Life Korea"
  activeNav="give"
>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:ital,wght@0,700;0,800;1,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<div class="give">

  <!-- ═══ HERO ═══ -->
  <section class="gv-hero">
    <div class="gv-hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="gv-hero-inner">
      <span class="gv-eyebrow">
        <span class="wl-ko">함께하는 사역</span>
        <span class="wl-en">Partner With Us</span>
      </span>
      <h1 class="gv-hero-title">
        <span class="wl-ko">사역에<br>동참해 주세요</span>
        <span class="wl-en">Support<br>the Mission</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="gv-hero-sub">
        <span class="wl-ko">여러분의 후원이 한국의 다음 세대를 복음으로<br>섬기는 월코 사역을 이어가게 합니다.</span>
        <span class="wl-en">Your generosity empowers Word of Life Korea<br>to reach the next generation with the Gospel.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ INVOLVEMENT SECTION ═══ -->
  <section class="gv-involve">
    <div class="gv-wrap">
      <div class="gv-involve-head">
        <span class="gv-tag">
          <span class="wl-ko">사역 참여</span>
          <span class="wl-en">Get Involved</span>
        </span>
        <h2 class="gv-section-title">
          <span class="wl-ko">함께 사역할 수 있는<br>다양한 방법이 있습니다</span>
          <span class="wl-en">There Are Many Ways<br>to Serve With Us</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="gv-involve-grid">

        <div class="gv-involve-card">
          <div class="gv-involve-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
              <!-- 머리 -->
              <circle cx="20" cy="13" r="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/>
              <!-- 몸 / 어깨 -->
              <path d="M10 33c0-5.52 4.48-10 10-10s10 4.48 10 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <!-- 옷깃 선 (약한 디테일) -->
              <path d="M17 23l3 4 3-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="gv-involve-title">
            <span class="wl-ko">캠프 스태프</span>
            <span class="wl-en">Camp Staff</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="gv-involve-desc">
            <span class="wl-ko">매년 진행되는 청소년 및 영어 캠프에서 스태프로 섬겨주세요. 다음 세대를 복음으로 만나는 현장에 함께합니다.</span>
            <span class="wl-en">Serve as a staff member at our annual youth and English camps. Join us on the frontlines of reaching the next generation with the Gospel.</span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gv-involve-card">
          <div class="gv-involve-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
              <!-- 지구 외곽 -->
              <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/>
              <!-- 위도선 -->
              <ellipse cx="20" cy="20" rx="14" ry="5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.45"/>
              <!-- 경도선 (세로 타원) -->
              <ellipse cx="20" cy="20" rx="6" ry="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.45"/>
              <!-- 수평 가운데선 -->
              <line x1="6" y1="20" x2="34" y2="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.45"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="gv-involve-title">
            <span class="wl-ko">해외 단기 선교</span>
            <span class="wl-en">Short-Term Mission</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="gv-involve-desc">
            <span class="wl-ko">베트남 등 해외 선교 현장에서 단기 선교사로 참여할 수 있습니다. 복음의 열방 확장에 직접 동참해 보세요.</span>
            <span class="wl-en">Join a short-term mission team to Vietnam and beyond. Experience the global reach of the Gospel firsthand.</span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gv-involve-card">
          <div class="gv-involve-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
              <!-- 종이 -->
              <rect x="8" y="5" width="18" height="24" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/>
              <!-- 줄 3개 (연필과 안 겹치게 길이 조절) -->
              <line x1="12" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.55"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="22" y2="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.55"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="22" x2="17" y2="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.55"/>
              <!-- 연필 (종이 오른쪽 아래 바깥) -->
              <g transform="translate(29,30) rotate(-45)">
                <rect x="-2" y="-9" width="4" height="11" rx="0.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path d="M-2 2 L0 6 L2 2Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="gv-involve-title">
            <span class="wl-ko">다양한 사역 동참</span>
            <span class="wl-en">Ministry Volunteering</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="gv-involve-desc">
            <span class="wl-ko">IT · 미디어 · 테크, 커리큘럼 번역, 학생 사역 등 각자의 은사로 사역에 기여할 수 있습니다.</span>
            <span class="wl-en">Contribute your skills in IT, media, tech, curriculum translation, student ministry, and more. Every gift matters.</span>
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
      <div class="gv-involve-cta">
        <a href="/contact" class="gv-involve-btn">
          <span class="wl-ko">참여 문의하기</span>
          <span class="wl-en">Get in Touch</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 10h12M12 4l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ SECTION 1 : 사역 후원 ═══ -->
  <section class="gv-ministry" id="ministry-give">
    <div class="gv-wrap">

      <div class="gv-section-head">
        <span class="gv-tag">
          <span class="wl-ko">사역 후원</span>
          <span class="wl-en">Ministry Support</span>
        </span>
        <h2 class="gv-section-title">
          <span class="wl-ko">월코 사역을<br>함께 세워가요</span>
          <span class="wl-en">Build the Ministry<br>Together</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="gv-section-desc">
          <span class="wl-ko">월코 본부 사역과 제주 캠프 건축, 그리고 베트남 선교를 위한 후원입니다.<br>여러분의 헌신이 복음의 다음 장을 씁니다.</span>
          <span class="wl-en">Support WOLKO's headquarters ministry, Jeju camp expansion, and Vietnam mission.<br>Your commitment writes the next chapter of the Gospel.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 국내사역 그룹 : 월코 + 제주 -->
      <div class="gv-domestic-group">
        <div class="gv-group-label-bar">
          <span class="wl-ko">국내 사역 후원</span>
          <span class="wl-en">Domestic Ministry</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gv-domestic-cards">

          <!-- Card: 월코 전체사역 -->
          <div class="gv-card gv-card-wolko">
            <div class="gv-card-top">
              <div class="gv-card-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <circle cx="22" cy="22" r="20" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.2)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                  <path d="M14 22l5 5 11-11" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.9)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="gv-card-title">
                  <span class="wl-ko">월코 전체사역 후원</span>
                  <span class="wl-en">WOLKO Ministry Fund</span>
                </h3>
                <p class="gv-card-desc">
                  <span class="wl-ko">캠프·제자훈련·전도 등 월코의 모든 국내 사역을 지원합니다.</span>
                  <span class="wl-en">Supports all of WOLKO's camp, discipleship, and outreach programs.</span>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gv-card-btns">
              <a href="https://online.mrm.or.kr/djPo2CH" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="gv-cbtn gv-cbtn-solid">
                <span class="wl-ko">정기후원</span>
                <span class="wl-en">Monthly</span>
              </a>
              <a href="https://online.mrm.or.kr/6eeXkHF" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="gv-cbtn gv-cbtn-ghost">
                <span class="wl-ko">일시후원</span>
                <span class="wl-en">One-time</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card: 제주월비 -->
          <div class="gv-card gv-card-jeju">
            <div class="gv-card-top">
              <div class="gv-card-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <circle cx="22" cy="22" r="20" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.2)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                  <path d="M8 30l7-9 5 6 4-5 12 8H8z" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.75)"/>
                  <circle cx="32" cy="16" r="3" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.45)"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="gv-card-title">
                  <span class="wl-ko">제주월비 후원</span>
                  <span class="wl-en">Jeju WOLBI Fund</span>
                </h3>
                <p class="gv-card-desc">
                  <span class="wl-ko">제주도 캠프 시설 건축과 사역 확장을 위한 후원입니다.</span>
                  <span class="wl-en">Supports the Jeju camp facility construction and ministry expansion.</span>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gv-card-btns">
              <a href="https://online.mrm.or.kr/djPo2CH" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="gv-cbtn gv-cbtn-solid">
                <span class="wl-ko">정기후원</span>
                <span class="wl-en">Monthly</span>
              </a>
              <a href="https://online.mrm.or.kr/6eeXkHF" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="gv-cbtn gv-cbtn-ghost">
                <span class="wl-ko">일시후원</span>
                <span class="wl-en">One-time</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ GRADIENT DIVIDER ═══ -->
  <div class="gv-gradient-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- ═══ SECTION 2 : 선교사 개인 후원 ═══ -->
  <section class="gv-missionary" id="missionary-give">
    <div class="gv-wrap">
      <div class="gv-mission-layout">

        <!-- Left: Text -->
        <div class="gv-mission-text">
          <span class="gv-tag gv-tag-light">
            <span class="wl-ko">선교사 개인 후원</span>
            <span class="wl-en">Missionary Support</span>
          </span>
          <h2 class="gv-section-title gv-section-title-light">
            <span class="wl-ko">한 사람의 선교사를<br>함께 세워가요</span>
            <span class="wl-en">Invest in a<br>Missionary's Life</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="gv-mission-body">
            <span class="wl-ko">월코 선교사들은 복음전파와 제자훈련을 위해 한국 전역과 해외 현장에서 헌신하고 있습니다. 선교사 개인 후원을 통해 한 사람의 사역과 삶을 직접 지원해 주세요.</span>
            <span class="wl-en">WOLKO missionaries are committed to Gospel proclamation and discipleship across Korea and beyond. Through personal missionary support, you directly invest in a specific missionary's life and ministry.</span>
          </p>
          <div class="gv-mission-note">
            <svg class="gv-note-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
              <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <path d="M10 9v5M10 6.5v.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <span class="wl-ko">후원을 시작하시면 담당 선교사가 감사 인사와 함께 정기적으로 사역 소식을 전해 드립니다.</span>
              <span class="wl-en">When you begin supporting a missionary, they will personally reach out and share regular updates from the field.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Give card -->
        <div class="gv-mission-give">
          <div class="gv-give-card">
            <div class="gv-give-card-label">
              <span class="wl-ko">후원 방법 선택</span>
              <span class="wl-en">Choose Your Gift Type</span>
            </div>

            <a href="https://online.mrm.or.kr/KoUtWvX" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="gv-give-row gv-give-row-regular">
              <div class="gv-give-row-info">
                <span class="gv-give-row-title wl-ko">정기후원</span>
                <span class="gv-give-row-title wl-en">Monthly Support</span>
                <span class="gv-give-row-sub wl-ko">매월 안정적으로 선교사를 돕습니다</span>
                <span class="gv-give-row-sub wl-en">Consistent monthly support for the missionary</span>
              </div>
              <svg class="gv-give-row-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </a>

            <a href="https://online.mrm.or.kr/qE1NHEc" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="gv-give-row gv-give-row-once">
              <div class="gv-give-row-info">
                <span class="gv-give-row-title wl-ko">일시후원</span>
                <span class="gv-give-row-title wl-en">One-time Gift</span>
                <span class="gv-give-row-sub wl-ko">한 번의 특별한 헌신으로 함께합니다</span>
                <span class="gv-give-row-sub wl-en">Make a special one-time contribution</span>
              </div>
              <svg class="gv-give-row-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </a>

            <div class="gv-give-card-divider"></div>

            <div class="gv-give-card-contact">
              <p class="gv-contact-label wl-ko">궁금한 점이 있으신가요?</p>
              <p class="gv-contact-label wl-en">Have questions?</p>
              <div class="gv-contact-btns">
                <a href="http://pf.kakao.com/_Rxidxkxj" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="gv-kakao-btn">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="gv-kakao-icon">
                    <path d="M12 3C6.48 3 2 6.69 2 11.25c0 2.9 1.9 5.45 4.77 6.89l-1.18 4.32a.4.4 0 0 0 .58.46L11.2 19.7A11 11 0 0 0 12 19.5c5.52 0 10-3.69 10-8.25S17.52 3 12 3z" fill="currentColor"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="wl-ko">카카오톡 문의</span>
                  <span class="wl-en">KakaoTalk</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/contact" class="gv-contact-link">
                  <span class="wl-ko">이메일 문의 →</span>
                  <span class="wl-en">Contact us →</span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ SECTION 3 : 베트남 선교 후원 ═══ -->
  <section class="gv-ministry" id="vietnam-give" style="background:#f4f7f9;">
    <div class="gv-wrap">
      <div class="gv-vietnam-group" style="margin-top:0;">
        <div class="gv-group-label-bar gv-group-label-bar--vn">
          <span class="wl-ko">🇻🇳 해외 선교 후원</span>
          <span class="wl-en">🇻🇳 Overseas Mission</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gv-card gv-card-vietnam gv-card-wide">
          <div class="gv-card-top">
            <div class="gv-card-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <circle cx="22" cy="22" r="20" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.2)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <circle cx="22" cy="18" r="5" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.9)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path d="M11 34c0-6.07 4.93-11 11-11s11 4.93 11 11" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.9)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="gv-card-title">
                <span class="wl-ko">베트남 선교 후원</span>
                <span class="wl-en">Vietnam Mission Support</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="gv-card-desc">
                <span class="wl-ko">베트남 현지 선교 사역과 교회 개척, 다음 세대 복음화를 위한 후원입니다.</span>
                <span class="wl-en">Supports on-the-ground mission work, church planting, and youth outreach in Vietnam.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="gv-card-btns">
            <a href="https://online.mrm.or.kr/yrPkWIu" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="gv-cbtn gv-cbtn-solid gv-cbtn-vn">
              <span class="wl-ko">베트남 선교 후원하기</span>
              <span class="wl-en">Give to Vietnam Mission</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/vietnam" class="gv-cbtn gv-cbtn-ghost">
              <span class="wl-ko">사역 자세히 보기</span>
              <span class="wl-en">Learn More</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ SECTION 4 : 해외 후원 ═══ -->
  <section class="gv-intl">
    <div class="gv-wrap">
      <div class="gv-intl-card">
        <div class="gv-intl-text">
          <span class="gv-tag">
            <span class="wl-ko">해외 거주자 후원</span>
            <span class="wl-en">International Giving</span>
          </span>
          <h3 class="gv-intl-title">
            <span class="wl-ko">해외에서 후원하시나요?</span>
            <span class="wl-en">Giving from Outside Korea?</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="gv-intl-desc">
            <span class="wl-ko">미국 및 해외 거주자분들께서는 Word of Life 국제 후원 페이지를 통해 한국 사역을 지원하실 수 있습니다.</span>
            <span class="wl-en">Donors based in the US or abroad can support Word of Life Korea through the international giving portal hosted by Word of Life International.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href="https://give.wol.org/location/southkorea" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="gv-intl-btn">
          <span class="wl-ko">국제 후원 페이지</span>
          <span class="wl-en">Give Internationally</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="gv-intl-btn-icon">
            <path d="M4 10h12M12 4l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
/* ── CSS variables on wrapper class, NOT :root ── */
.give {
  --gv-deep:  #02263a;
  --gv-navy:  #004f68;
  --gv-mid:   #007ea1;
  --gv-sky:   #73d1f5;
  --gv-ink:   #12303c;
  --gv-muted: #5a6f79;
  --gv-line:  #dde6ea;
  --gv-bg:    #f4f7f9;
  --gv-red:   #c42a36;
  font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
  color: var(--gv-ink);
